				    (object Class "Connection"
					quid       	"443F7B8A01F4"
					documentation 	"A structure can have multiple connection points for electrical connections (e.g. line) each with multiple mounting points, one for each phase. e.g. a Tower may have three Connections, two with three mounting points, one for each phase and a third with a single mounting point for the neutral line. A pole, on the other hand, may have a single Connection with one, two or three mounting points depending on whether it is carrying 1,2 or 3 phases."
