					documentation 	"A hazard is any object or condition that is a danger for causing loss or perils to an asset and/or people.  Examples of hazards are trees growing under overhead power lines, a park being located by a substation (i.e., children climb fence to recover a ball), a lake near an overhead distribution line (fishing pole/line contacting power lines), etc.  "
