					quid       	"4106EA4E035C"
					documentation 	"Roles played between Documents and Locations.  For example, as ErpAddress is a type of Location and WorkBilling is a type of Document, a role is the address for which to mail the invoice.  As a TroubleTicket is a type of Document, one instance of Location may be the address for which the trouble is reported."
